  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">如需服务器，请查看我们的合作伙伴<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d618\" rel=\"nofollow\">动能主机(Kinetic Hosting)</a>：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d618\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5laobu2.png\" width=\"404\" height=\"87\"></strong></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">允许像Optifine一样进行视角缩放。许多其他模组会与Rubidium等模组产生冲突，本模组旨在解决这些问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">默认使用C键缩放（可在按键设置中修改）。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">缩放时可通过鼠标滚轮调整倍率。极限缩放可能会导致画面异常。</span></p>",
